  "canon:pmid": "31893076",
  "canon:title": "Ergometrine for postpartum hemorrhage and associated myocardial ischemia: Two case reports and a review of the literature.",
  "canon:abstract": "Ergometrine is recommended for use in the medical treatment of postpartum hemorrhage. Ergometrine can occasionally precipitate myocardial ischemia in the setting of significant anemia in women without preexisting cardiac risk factors, and it is important to recognize and treat myocardial ischemia in affected patients to prevent severe complications.",
  "canon:text": "Ergometrine for postpartum hemorrhage and associated myocardial ischemia: Two case reports and a review of the literature. Ergometrine is recommended for use in the medical treatment of postpartum hemorrhage. Ergometrine can occasionally precipitate myocardial ischemia in the setting of significant anemia in women without preexisting cardiac risk factors, and it is important to recognize and treat myocardial ischemia in affected patients to prevent severe complications.",
